  "configuration": "One active GPU on the same two-GPU host; GPU0 baseline variant and wall-clock timing, both workers ready. Three waveform sizes and one 512x288 high-entropy fixture; each tested once in fixed 0/1/2 policy order. All use 2 steps, alpha 0.1, seed 42, input JPEG85/output JPEG80, requested 60 sends/s, about 30 seconds after 20 warmup frames, pending limit 3 and client buffered-byte threshold 262144. Telemetry polling disabled.",
